msgid ""
msgstr ""
"# Migrating from GPU to NPU\n"
"\n"
"This guide provides a comprehensive overview of how to migrate your model from GPU to NPU, covering the entire process from basic environment setup to advanced optimization techniques.\n"
"\n"
"## 1. Environment Setup\n"
"\n"
"### 1.1 Install CANN Toolkit\n"
"\n"
"First, you need to install the CANN Toolkit, which is the core software stack for Ascend NPU. You can download it from the official Huawei website and install it according to the installation guide.\n"
"\n"
"### 1.2 Configure Environment Variables\n"
"\n"
"After installation, you need to configure the following environment variables:\n"
"\n"
"```bash\n"
"export ASCEND_HOME=/usr/local/Ascend\n"
"export PATH=$ASCEND_HOME/ascend-toolkit/latest/bin:$PATH\n"
"export LD_LIBRARY_PATH=$ASCEND_HOME/ascend-toolkit/latest/lib64:$LD_LIBRARY_PATH\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"## 2. Code Migration\n"
"\n"
"### 2.1 Replace CUDA with Ascend\n"
"\n"
"Replace all CUDA-related operations with Ascend equivalents. The main changes include:\n"
"\n"
"- Replace `torch.cuda` with `torch_npu.npu`\n"
"- Replace `cuda()` with `npu()`\n"
"- Replace CUDA-specific APIs with Ascend-specific APIs\n"
"\n"
"### 2.2 Modify Model Definition\n"
"\n"
"```python\n"
"# Original GPU code\n"
"model = MyModel().cuda()\n"
"\n"
"# Migrated NPU code\n"
"import torch_npu\n"
"model = MyModel().npu()\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"### 2.3 Data Transfer\n"
"\n"
"```python\n"
"# Original GPU code\n"
"data = data.cuda()\n"
"label = label.cuda()\n"
"\n"
"# Migrated NPU code\n"
"data = data.npu()\n"
"label = label.npu()\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"## 3. Operator Adaptation\n"
"\n"
"### 3.1 Supported Operators\n"
"\n"
"Most common operators are supported on NPU. However, some operators may have different implementations or performance characteristics. Check the operator support list in the CANN documentation.\n"
"\n"
"### 3.2 Custom Operators\n"
"\n"
"If your model uses custom operators, you need to:\n"
"\n"
"1. Implement them using the Ascend Custom Operator framework\n"
"2. Test them thoroughly on NPU\n"
"3. Optimize performance if necessary\n"
"\n"
"## 4. Performance Optimization\n"
"\n"
"### 4.1 Memory Optimization\n"
"\n"
"- Use `torch_npu` memory management features\n"
"- Optimize batch size and sequence length\n"
"- Use mixed precision training with FP16\n"
"\n"
"### 4.2 Graph Optimization\n"
"\n"
"- Use static graph mode for better performance\n"
"- Enable graph optimization flags in CANN\n"
"- Use operator fusion techniques\n"
"\n"
"### 4.3 Parallelism\n"
"\n"
"- Use data parallelism with multiple NPUs\n"
"- Implement pipeline parallelism for large models\n"
"- Use model parallelism when necessary\n"
"\n"
"## 5. Debugging and Testing\n"
"\n"
"### 5.1 Common Issues\n"
"\n"
"- Operator compatibility issues\n"
"- Memory allocation failures\n"
"- Precision differences between GPU and NPU\n"
"\n"
"### 5.2 Debugging Tools\n"
"\n"
"- Use Ascend Debugger for operator-level debugging\n"
"- Use profiling tools to identify bottlenecks\n"
"- Compare outputs with GPU results for validation\n"
"\n"
"## 6. Best Practices\n"
"\n"
"### 6.1 Code Structure\n"
"\n"
"- Keep device-agnostic code separate from device-specific code\n"
"- Use configuration files for device settings\n"
"- Implement fallback mechanisms for unsupported features\n"
"\n"
"### 6.2 Testing Strategy\n"
"\n"
"- Test on small datasets first\n"
"- Validate numerical accuracy\n"
"- Benchmark performance against GPU baseline\n"
"\n"
"### 6.3 Documentation\n"
"\n"
"- Document all device-specific changes\n"
"- Maintain migration guides for future reference\n"
"- Share lessons learned with the team\n"
"\n"
"## 7. Conclusion\n"
"\n"
"Migrating from GPU to NPU requires careful planning and execution. By following this guide, you can ensure a smooth migration process while maintaining performance and accuracy. Remember to test thoroughly and optimize iteratively for the best results.\n"

msgid "GPU Triton算子迁移"
msgstr "Migrating GPU Triton Operators"

msgid "概述：本文介绍 GPU Triton 算子迁移到昇腾 NPU 时的通用处理思路和常见问题。迁移时建议先完成 Python 侧设备与运行时接口替换，再检查 grid 分核、访存对齐、单核计算、UB 空间和 coreDim 限制，最后结合具体示例完成代码修改和正确性验证。"
msgstr "Overview: This article introduces the general handling approach and common issues when migrating GPU Triton operators to Ascend NPU. During migration, it is recommended to first complete the replacement of device and runtime interfaces on the Python side, then check grid core partitioning, memory access alignment, single-core computation, UB space, and coreDim limits, and finally complete code modifications and correctness verification based on specific examples."

msgid "通用迁移流程"
msgstr "General Migration Process"

msgid "迁移 Python 侧设备和运行时接口"
msgstr "Migrate Python-side device and runtime interfaces."

msgid "在修改具体 Triton kernel 前，先完成 Python 侧设备迁移："
msgstr "Before modifying the specific Triton kernel, first complete the device migration on the Python side:"

msgid "在 Python 文件中增加 `import torch_npu`。"
msgstr "Add `import torch_npu` to the Python file."

msgid "查找 `device=\"cuda\"`、`device='cuda'`、`.cuda()` 和 `.to(\"cuda\")` 等设备指定方式，改为 `device=\"npu\"`、`device='npu'`、`.npu()` 或 `.to(\"npu\")`。"
msgstr "Search for device specifications such as `device=\"cuda\"`, `device='cuda'`, `.cuda()`, and `.to(\"cuda\")`, and change them to `device=\"npu\"`, `device='npu'`, `.npu()`, or `.to(\"npu\")`."

msgid "查找 `torch.cuda.*`、CUDA stream、CUDA event、CUDA synchronize 等 GPU 专属接口，改为 NPU 对应接口或删除不必要的同步逻辑。"
msgstr "Search for GPU-specific interfaces such as `torch.cuda.*`, CUDA stream, CUDA event, CUDA synchronize, and replace them with the corresponding NPU interfaces or remove unnecessary synchronization logic."

msgid "删除只为 GPU 设备发现服务的逻辑，例如 `triton.runtime.driver.active.get_active_torch_device()` 相关设备断言。"
msgstr "Remove logic that exists solely for GPU device discovery, such as device assertions related to `triton.runtime.driver.active.get_active_torch_device()`."

msgid "保持 Triton kernel 主体逻辑不变，先用 NPU Tensor 完成编译和正确性验证。"
msgstr "Keep the main logic of the Triton kernel unchanged, and first use NPU Tensor to complete compilation and correctness verification."

msgid "调整 grid 分核"
msgstr "Adjust the grid core allocation."

msgid "GPU 上常见的写法会把 grid 设计为大量逻辑 program，由硬件和运行时调度到 SM 上执行。迁移到 NPU 时，应优先考虑物理 AI Core 数量和算子类型："
msgstr "A common practice on GPUs is to design the grid as a large number of logical programs, which are scheduled onto SMs by the hardware and runtime. When migrating to NPUs, priority should be given to the physical number of AI Cores and the operator types."

msgid "grid 优先使用 1D；2D NPU 适配写法也会合并为 1D，例如 `(20,)` 与 `(4, 5)` 的效果相同。"
msgstr "grid prioritizes 1D; 2D NPU-adapted syntax will also be merged into 1D, for example, `(20,)` and `(4, 5)` have the same effect."

msgid "Vector-only 算子的并发任务数通常按 Vector Core 数量组织；包含 `tl.dot` 的算子通常按 AI Core 数量组织。"
msgstr "Concurrent task counts for Vector-only operators are typically organized by the number of Vector Cores; operators containing `tl.dot` are typically organized by the number of AI Cores."

msgid "当逻辑 grid 远大于物理核数时，需要评估是否改成每个 program 内部循环处理多个 tile，或在逻辑核之间无顺序依赖时使用 `TRITON_ALL_BLOCKS_PARALLEL`。"
msgstr "When the logical grid is much larger than the number of physical cores, evaluate whether to change to looping over multiple tiles within each program, or use `TRITON_ALL_BLOCKS_PARALLEL` when there is no sequential dependency between logical cores."

msgid "coreDim 不能超过 `UINT16_MAX`（65535），大 shape 算子需要结合 BLOCK_SIZE 或分块方式控制 grid 大小。"
msgstr "coreDim cannot exceed `UINT16_MAX` (65535). Operators with large shapes need to control the grid size by combining BLOCK_SIZE or using a block-based approach."

msgid "维度"
msgstr "Dimension"

msgid "核心结构"
msgstr "Core structure"

msgid "算子类型"
msgstr "Operator type"

msgid "昇腾 NPU (Ascend)"
msgstr "Ascend NPU"

msgid "多个 AI Core，分为 Cube Core（矩阵乘）和 Vector Core（向量计算）"
msgstr "Multiple AI Cores, divided into Cube Core (matrix multiplication) and Vector Core (vector computation)."

msgid "Vector-only 算子 → 并发任务数 = Vector Core 数；含 `tl.dot` 算子 → 并发任务数 = AI Core 数"
msgstr "Vector-only operators → number of concurrent tasks = number of Vector Cores; operators containing `tl.dot` → number of concurrent tasks = number of AI Cores."

msgid "GPU NVIDIA/AMD"
msgstr "NVIDIA/AMD GPU"

msgid "多个 CUDA Core（标量/向量计算） + Tensor Core（矩阵乘）"
msgstr "Multiple CUDA Cores (scalar/vector computation) + Tensor Cores (matrix multiplication)"

msgid "GPU 算子一般由编译器和硬件自动决定并发度"
msgstr "GPU operators generally have their concurrency automatically determined by the compiler and hardware."

msgid "检查单核数据搬运"
msgstr "Check single-core data transfer."

msgid "完成设备替换后，需要继续检查单个 program 内的数据搬运方式："
msgstr "After completing the device replacement, it is necessary to continue checking the data transfer method within a single program."

msgid "Vector 算子场景下要求 32 字节访存对齐，cube-vector 融合算子场景下要求 512 字节对齐。"
msgstr "In the Vector operator scenario, 32-byte memory access alignment is required; in the cube-vector fusion operator scenario, 512-byte alignment is required."

msgid "保留 tail mask，确认边界元素不会越界访问。"
msgstr "Keep the tail mask and ensure that boundary elements do not cause out-of-bounds access."

msgid "检查一次 tile 的片上内存占用，避免触发 UB 空间溢出。"
msgstr "Check the on-chip memory usage of a tile once to avoid triggering UB space overflow."

msgid "移除或替换 GPU 专属同步 API，例如 CUDA thread、stream、event 或 kernel synchronize 相关接口。"
msgstr "Remove or replace GPU-specific synchronization APIs, such as CUDA thread, stream, event, or kernel synchronize related interfaces."

msgid "检查单核数据运算"
msgstr "Check single-core data computation."

msgid "NPU 与 GPU 的计算单元和支持的数据类型存在差异。迁移后应先保证正确性，再根据性能问题调整："
msgstr "NPU and GPU differ in their compute units and supported data types. After migration, correctness should be ensured first, and then adjustments should be made based on performance issues."

msgid "对整数索引、offset、长度等中间值，优先确认当前数据类型是否被 NPU 路径高效支持。"
msgstr "For intermediate values such as integer indices, offsets, and lengths, first confirm whether the current data type is efficiently supported by the NPU path."

msgid "对含 `tl.dot` 的算子，确认 M/N/K tile、累加 dtype 和输出 dtype 是否符合 NPU 后端要求。"
msgstr "For operators containing `tl.dot`, confirm whether the M/N/K tile, accumulation dtype, and output dtype meet the NPU backend requirements."

msgid "对长序列、长 hidden size 或大 K 维循环，优先通过 tiling 控制单次搬入和计算规模。"
msgstr "For long sequences, long hidden sizes, or large K-dimensional loops, prioritize controlling the size of each data transfer and computation through tiling."

msgid "迁移示例"
msgstr "Migration example"

msgid "示例 1：向量加法完整迁移"
msgstr "Example 1: Complete Migration of Vector Addition"

msgid "示例 2：设备替换与单核数据搬运"
msgstr "Example 2: Device Replacement and Single-Core Data Transfer"

msgid "以下示例展示将设备从 CUDA 替换为 NPU 后，对单核数据搬运场景进行正确性验证："
msgstr "The following example demonstrates correctness verification for a single-core data transfer scenario after replacing the device from CUDA with NPU:"

msgid "常见问题概览"
msgstr "Frequently Asked Questions Overview"

msgid "完成迁移基础步骤后，可能会遇到新的问题，新问题可归纳为以下两类："
msgstr "After completing the basic migration steps, you may encounter new issues, which can be categorized into the following two types:"

msgid "coreDim 限制问题"
msgstr "coreDim limit issue"

msgid "当网格维度超过NPU硬件限制时触发。 典型错误信息：`coreDim=xxxx can't be greater than UINT16_MAX`。"
msgstr "Triggered when the grid dimension exceeds the NPU hardware limit. Typical error message: `coreDim=xxxx can't be greater than UINT16_MAX`."

msgid "UB 空间溢出"
msgstr "UB space overflow"

msgid "内存使用超出NPU缓存容量。 典型错误信息：`ub overflow, requires xxxx bits while 1572864 bits available!`。"
msgstr "Memory usage exceeds NPU cache capacity. Typical error message: `ub overflow, requires xxxx bits while 1572864 bits available!`"

msgid "解决 coreDim 超限问题"
msgstr "Resolve the coreDim limit issue."

msgid "问题分析: NPU的 coreDim 参数不能超过 UINT16_MAX（65535）。当处理大规模数据时，简单的grid划分可能导致该限制被突破。"
msgstr "Problem Analysis: The `coreDim` parameter of the NPU cannot exceed UINT16_MAX (65535). When processing large-scale data, simple grid partitioning may cause this limit to be exceeded."

msgid "案例：zeros_like 函数优化 数据规模：N = 1073741824，原始 BLOCK_SIZE = 2048，计算得到的 coreDim = 524288 > 65535（超限）"
msgstr "Case: zeros_like function optimization Data scale: N = 1073741824, original BLOCK_SIZE = 2048, computed coreDim = 524288 > 65535 (exceeds limit)"

