msgstr "Solution 1: The Ascend compiler has a corresponding solution for the coreDim over-limit issue. Simply set the environment variable 'TRITON_ALL_BLOCKS_PARALLEL' to 1. The setting command is as follows:"

msgid "解决思路2： 通过增大 BLOCK_SIZE 来减少所需的核心数量，确保 coreDim 不超过限制。 计算公式如下："
msgstr "Solution Approach 2: Reduce the number of required cores by increasing BLOCK_SIZE, ensuring that coreDim does not exceed the limit. The calculation formula is as follows:"

msgid "代入 `N = 1073741824` 可得："
msgstr "Substituting `N = 1073741824` yields:"

msgid "因此，如果 `BLOCK_SIZE` 按 2 的幂取值，至少应设置为 `32768`。"
msgstr "Therefore, if `BLOCK_SIZE` is taken as a power of 2, it should be set to at least `32768`."

msgid "优化前的代码："
msgstr "Code before optimization:"

msgid "优化后的代码："
msgstr "Optimized code:"

msgid "动态计算适合的 BLOCK_SIZE 以避免 coreDim 超限"
msgstr "Dynamically calculate the appropriate BLOCK_SIZE to avoid exceeding the coreDim limit."

msgid "处理复合问题：coreDim + UB 溢出"
msgstr "Handling composite issues: coreDim + UB overflow"

msgid "问题分析: 在某些情况下，解决了 coreDim 问题后可能引发新的UB溢出问题。这通常发生在增大 BLOCK_SIZE 后，单个线程块需要处理的数据量超出了NPU的UB缓存容量。"
msgstr "Problem analysis: In some cases, resolving the coreDim issue may introduce new UB overflow problems. This typically occurs after increasing BLOCK_SIZE, when the amount of data that a single thread block needs to process exceeds the UB cache capacity of the NPU."

msgid "案例： 数据规模：N = 1073741824，原始 BLOCK_SIZE = 4096，计算得到的 coreDim = 262144 > 65535（超限），调整为 BLOCK_SIZE = 32768 后，coreDim = 32768（合规），但出现 UB 溢出"
msgstr "Case: Data size: N = 1073741824, original BLOCK_SIZE = 4096, calculated coreDim = 262144 > 65535 (exceeds limit), after adjusting BLOCK_SIZE = 32768, coreDim = 32768 (compliant), but UB overflow occurs."

msgid "解决思路： 引入 BLOCK_SIZE_SUB 参数，将大块进一步细分，在保持合理 coreDim 的同时控制内存使用。 优化前代码："
msgstr "Solution approach: Introduce the BLOCK_SIZE_SUB parameter to further subdivide large blocks, controlling memory usage while maintaining a reasonable coreDim. Code before optimization:"

msgid "优化后代码："
msgstr "Optimized code:"

msgid "为什么会出现UBSIZE超出内存的错误"
msgstr "Why does the UBSIZE out-of-memory error occur?"

msgid "切分不合理,存在过多的非对齐访存或者运算，例如对（64，32）二维数据搬运，对应stride(12832，128),如果是对齐数据的访存，对应的stride(32,1)。 对于非对齐访问内容，在最内轴新增一个大小为1的轴，变为（64，32，4） 由于硬件要求vector算子场景ub内存32bytes对齐 ，假设type=float16，对应stride应该为(12832, 128,1)"
msgstr "The segmentation is unreasonable, with excessive misaligned memory access or computation. For example, for moving (64, 32) two-dimensional data, the corresponding stride is (12832, 128). If it is aligned data access, the corresponding stride should be (32, 1). For misaligned access content, add a new axis of size 1 to the innermost axis, changing it to (64, 32, 4). Since the hardware requires 32-byte alignment for UB memory in vector operator scenarios, assuming type=float16, the corresponding stride should be (12832, 128, 1)."

msgid "离散访存代码逐行对比观察scalar低效映射"
msgstr "Observe the scalar inefficient mapping line by line in the discrete memory access code."

msgid "设置环境变量TRITON_DEBUG=1, 保存~/.triton/cache/xxx.ttadapter，然后执行"
msgstr "Set the environment variable TRITON_DEBUG=1, save ~/.triton/cache/xxx.ttadapter, and then execute"

msgid "会有输出IR ， 对比Triton 算子逻辑与IR内部的操作，观察是否有未映射成指令的操作。 观察HIVM IR阶段是否存在纯scalar搬运或者计算， 没有映射为simd指令，这会成为性能瓶颈。"
msgstr "There will be output IR. Compare the Triton operator logic with the operations inside the IR, and observe whether there are any operations that have not been mapped to instructions. Observe whether there is pure scalar data movement or computation in the HIVM IR stage that has not been mapped to SIMD instructions, as this will become a performance bottleneck."

msgid "问题：离散访存 && scalar低效映射 b[1024, 32] = a[1024, 32]  Triton原先写法利用thread的方式 对[1024,32] 中的最低维度32绑定线程块, 再对1024切16，分为[64， 16， 32]，再对64绑定线程块"
msgstr "Problem: Discontinuous memory access && scalar inefficient mapping b[1024, 32] = a[1024, 32] The original Triton implementation uses a thread-based approach, binding the lowest dimension 32 in [1024, 32] to thread blocks, then splitting 1024 into 16, resulting in [64, 16, 32], and then binding 64 to thread blocks."

msgid "优化思路"
msgstr "Optimization approach."

msgid "调整 block_ptr 的 shape/stride: 把 (1024, 32) 看成二维矩阵，最低维度 32 是连续的，所以 stride 应该是 (32, 1)，而不是 (32,)，这样每个线程块能访问连续的 32 元素。让线程块绑定到行维度（1024），每个线程处理一整行的 32 元素。这样访存就是连续的，亲和性好。"
msgstr "Adjust the shape/stride of block_ptr: treat (1024, 32) as a two-dimensional matrix, where the lowest dimension of 32 is contiguous, so the stride should be (32, 1) instead of (32,), allowing each thread block to access 32 contiguous elements. Bind the thread block to the row dimension (1024), with each thread processing an entire row of 32 elements. This makes memory access contiguous and improves affinity."

msgid "比如："
msgstr "For example:"
